  error                status  action     why
  rate limited            429  retry      after the 7s it asked for
  out of credit           429  fail       no retry will pay the bill
  server error            500  retry      the provider's fault; then fall back
  overloaded              503  retry      the provider's fault; then fall back
  timed out                 -  retry      transient; fall back if it persists
  connection refused        -  retry      transient; fall back if it persists
  prompt too long         400  shrink     trim it, or route to a larger window
  malformed request       400  fail       every provider will refuse it
  bad key                 401  fail       configuration: page a person
  no access to model      404  fall back  another provider may serve it

Clarity's gateway on a malformed request: primary called 1, backup called 1.
It falls back on every exception, so a request no provider will accept is sent
to each of them in turn, and its real cause arrives inside a RuntimeError.
